{"id":348,"date":"2017-05-27T11:17:07","date_gmt":"2017-05-27T11:17:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/?page_id=348"},"modified":"2021-07-19T15:39:41","modified_gmt":"2021-07-19T14:39:41","slug":"excel-accounting","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-accounting\/","title":{"rendered":"How To Keep Accounts In Excel"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/08\/excel-accounting.jpg\" alt=\"Excel Accounting &amp; Stock Control\" class=\"wp-image-24560 lazyload\" title=\"Excel Accounting &amp; Stock Control\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/302;\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<h2>Accounting In Excel For Small &amp; Medium Businesses\u00a0<\/h2>\n<h3><br \/>Analyse Data FAST<\/h3>\n<p><br \/>We provide accountancy-based Excel solutions for businesses of all sizes and in all manner of industries. If you need an existing financial spreadsheet overhauled to make it more efficient and user-friendly, that\u2019s what we do! We can also implement or expand upon your own ideas or requests to make Excel accounting and stock control work for you.<br \/><br \/>Whether it\u2019s a simple income and expenditure account, a cash flow forecast, something to track your inventory \u2013 or anything else \u2013 \u2018The Excel Experts\u2019 can help.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/contact-us\/\">Contact us today<\/a> and take advantage of our 100% no questions asked atisfaction guraantee.\u00a0<\/p>\n<h3><br \/>Stock control<\/h3>\n<p><br \/>All stock has a value, and needs to be accounted for. Also, it needs to be in the right place at the right time \u2013 so Excel stock control works hand in glove with Excel accounting.<\/p>\n<p>We are commissioned to carry out a lot of work in this area \u2013 this can range from bespoke worksheets for calculating stock requirements, to applications, and everything in between \u2013 including hybrid software to handle both warehouse and E-commerce operations.<\/p>\n<p>The main drawback of off-the-shelf stock control software is that it tries to be everything at once, to meet the needs of many different types of businesses \u2013 and even if it is designed for your wider business niche, it will never be a 100% bespoke fit for your exact requirements.<br \/><br \/>For most businesses, stock control is not usually all that complex, and a bespoke Excel solution is often the most cost-effective solution to provide bespoke-tailored software that is designed and implemented just for you.<br \/>Contact \u2018The Excel Experts\u2019 now for advice on accounting and stock control with Excel, or to get a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-specialists\/\">specialist Excel consultant<\/a> on your team.<\/p>\n<h3><strong><br \/>How Excel can help you with Automating the Financial Processes.<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><br \/>Excel automation (VBA and C#) improves the efficiency and the motivation of your business and team:<\/p>\n<p>Improved efficiency saves time and helps your team stay focused on value added tasks, increasing your team\u2019s motivation. The Excel Experts analyse, streamline your Financial process, automate, and simplify your complex reports. We love to make use of powerful C#, the robust version of VBA. These are just some examples we have implermented:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Automation of Consolidation process (IFRS)<\/li>\n<li>Direct link with as Xero,<\/li>\n<li>Dynamic databases updated hourly to generate standardised xls reports via VBA query.<\/li>\n<li>Re-organising of chaotic unrelated excel databases into CSV files using ADO technology.<\/li>\n<li>Automatic reconciliation analysis.<\/li>\n<li>Automatic power point generators by interfacing excel making use of C#.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Our goal is to tailor finance applications to boost productivity and improve the quality of analysis throughout your organisation to better support business decisions with data-driven insights.<\/p>\n<h3><strong><br \/>Why Excel and Beyond Excel is the right starting point.<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><br \/>We do not impose the ultimate all-purpose global model, we act at your side and tailor your solutions according to your ways of working.<\/p>\n<p>We know your vertical and we will satisfy your needs.<\/p>\n<p>Explore our beyond Excel solutions, VBA helps you to achieve amazing results but sometime you need robust plug and play C# professional developer solutions.<\/p>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Accounting In Excel For Small &amp; Medium Businesses\u00a0 Analyse Data FAST We provide accountancy-based Excel solutions for businesses of all sizes and in all manner of industries. If you need an existing financial spreadsheet overhauled to make it more efficient and user-friendly, that\u2019s what we do! We can also implement or expand upon your own<a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-accounting\/\" title=\"ReadHow To Keep Accounts In Excel\">&#8230; Read more &raquo;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-348","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Excel Accounting - Excel S